# EdgeLLM — example environment / secret reference.
#
# Microcontrollers don't read .env files at runtime. This file documents every
# secret EdgeLLM uses so you know what to provision (into NVS via the secret
# store, the provisioning portal in a later phase, or arduino_secrets.h for
# quick demos). NEVER commit real values — copy what you need and keep it local.

# --- WiFi (used by the network examples) ---
WIFI_SSID=your-wifi-ssid
WIFI_PASSWORD=your-wifi-password

# --- LLM provider API keys (used from Phase 2 onward) ---
# Stored under these logical keys in the secret store (ISecretStore):
#   anthropic_api_key, openai_api_key, gemini_api_key
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
GEMINI_API_KEY=...

# Ollama / OpenAI-compatible local endpoints typically need no key. Example:
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.50:11434

# --- MCP server (used from Phase 4 onward) ---
# Optional bearer token required on mutating (write) MCP tools.
MCP_BEARER_TOKEN=choose-a-long-random-token
